ge row Interrogation. Pilot excludes the robot, power armor and military rows and the three spacecraft; the worn Space: Antigrav Suit and Space: Contragravity Pak stay. Horsemanship and Holistic Medicine counting as two selections is in the note, not enforced. || MONEY: 4D6x100 credits; the 2D4x1000 in trade items is a restriction line. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: the light or medium M.D. armor (the book names no suit), two pairs of boots and spare laces, a hat or helmet, 1D4 waterproof sacks, a spool of wire and a ball of string (20 feet each), four wooden and two iron spikes, the folding utility knife, fish gutting knife and folding saw, a dozen chemical lights, the weapons (one per W.P. with 1D4 E-Clips each, often a handed-down favourite) and the vehicles. They are in GM Notes and the restrictions."
